{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04374","headline":"庆云章 · 陈子昂","name":"庆云章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崑仑元气，实生庆云。\n大人作矣，五色氤氲。\n昔在帝嬀，南风既薰。\n丛芳烂熳，郁郁纷纷。\n旷矣千祀，庆云来止。\n玉叶金柯，祚我天子。\n非我天子，庆云谁昌。\n非我圣母，庆云谁光。\n庆云光矣，周道昌矣。\n九万八千，天授皇年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04374.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04374","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}